<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id">- Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">DANIELI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Danieli</para>
  <para style="toc2">Danieli</para>
  <para style="toc3">Dani</para>
  <para style="mt2">CHITABU CHA DANIELI</para>
  <para style="mt1">DANIELI</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="iot">Chitabu cha Danieli</para>
  <para style="ip">Chatamwila wikazi na uwoni wa muwoni Danieli umo Waizulaeli wendaga wakekala ko utumwa uko Babeli. Chatamwila ivyo Danieli na wambuyaze wendile wakanuni kwa Chohile, iviya china mbuli za uwoni kulanga wantu wakwikala muno mwe izisi ntuhu. Chitabu chino chalanga mbuli zilaile kukongela mhilimo wa 605 kubula 535 Kulisito henati kwalekwa, umo Danieli nendile akasankana mwe vipindi vya maseuta wane wesimane wa Babeli. Wasomile wakale wazumila kugamba Danieli mwenye nuyo awandikaga chino ichitabu uko Babeli mwe chipindi chino, mna wasomile wa haluse walozize wazumila kugamba chawandikangwa nyumani, uko Izulaeli, mwe kaline ya kaidi Kulisito henati kwelekwa. Watuhu wazumila kugamba vipinka mwe chitabu chino viwandikwa mwe vipindi vyesimane.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Danieli chawandikagwa chani chiwenke msuhi wantu wa Izulaeli wendile wakekala ko usamizo, iviya mwe vyeleko vikwiza navikale mwe chipindi chidala. Chohile alagisa nguvu zakwe mwa maseuta na wantu we izisi ntuhu, kujinkila mwe mbuli zilaile mo wikazi wa Danieli na mo uwaoni mwa mazuwa yakwiza. Kuligana na mawandiko ye Bibiliya, chitabu chino chambiza kukombaganya mbuli zo useuta wa Chohile mwe Lagano hya. Mligano, Mwambula nakalotelwa Danieli sula ya 7:13-14. Uwoni wa Danieli kulanga mazuwa yo udumo yalongwa ni Yesu, ukasoma Matayo 24:15 na Mako 13:14, iviya ni sayadya yawandikwe mwe chitabu cho Ugubulo wa Yohana. Iviya Danieli kawandika kulanga mazuwa yo udumo kwa kuliganya na uwoni wa Yelemiya, ukasoma Danieli 9:1-3.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yemndani</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya 1 kubula 4 zalonga kulanga Danieli na wambuyaze uko Babeli chipindi cho useuta Nebukadineza.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Iviya Sula ya 5 yatambalisa mwe utapita wa Danieli mwe uwoni wa seuta Belishaza.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Chitabu chino yatamwila kumlanga Danieli mwe bome dya simba mo useuta wa seuta Dalio, mwe sula ya 6.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Iviya chitabu chino chaachisanya ugubulo uwo Chohile amwinkile Danieli mwe mbuli zikwiza mwe sula za 7 kubula 12.</para>
  <para style="io">Iviya Danieli atambalisa uwoni wihaidi mwa mazuwa yakwiza no utapita wakwe mwe sula ya 7 na 8.</para>
  <para style="io">Iviya Danieli awalombezeza watu wakwe na mndima ywa kwembingu Gabulieli amhitula, mwe sula ya 9.</para>
  <para style="io">Udumo Gabulieli agubula mbuli nazilaile nyumani, hamwenga na vipindi vyo udumo, mwe sula ya 10-12.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DAN 1" />
  <para style="s">Danieli na wambuyaze uko Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 1:1" />Mo mhilimo wa katatu wo ulongozi wa Yehoyakimu seuta ywa Yuda, Nebukadiza seuta ywa Babeli na wagomba nkondo wakwe waitaga komzi wa Yelusalemu na kuutandama chani wawebunge. <verse eid="DAN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 1:2" />Zumbe Chohile amlekaga Yehoyakimu seuta ywa Yuda agwilwe ni Nebukadiniza hamwenga na viya visiku kulawa mwe Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile. Nebukadineza kataha wantu ne iviya kavigala kweisi ya Shinali na kuvika mwe vyumba vye milungu yakwe.<verse eid="DAN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 1:3" />Vikaheza, seuta Nebukadineza niyo amlagiza Ashipenazi mkulu ywa masekulu we dizumba dyakwe dye chiseuta, amsagwile wabwanga wasiku wa Izulaeli kulawa mwa wantu we kaya ye chiseuta na wantu wakutunyiswa. <verse eid="DAN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 1:4" />Seuta aungaga wabwanga watana hewene lema mwe imili, wata udahi na ubala naho wata akili na umanyi wakuwagila kusankana mwe dizumba dye chiseuta. Iviya seuta kaunga wabwanga awo wahinywe kusoma na kuwandika kwa longa dya Wakalidayo. <verse eid="DAN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 1:5" />Iviya seuta kalagiza wabwanga awo wenkigwe nkande yedi idya akudya mwenye ne divai iyo akunywa. Wabwanga awo nendile waungwa wahinywe kwa mihilimo mitatu, wakaheza wegalwe wakamsankanile seuta. <verse eid="DAN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 1:6" />Mgati mwa wabwanga awo wasagulwe wendaga ni Danieli na Hananiya na Mishaeli na Azaliya, wose walawa mwe dikabila dya Yuda. <verse eid="DAN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 1:7" />Mkulu ywa masekulu niyo awenka mazina matuhu, Danieli kamwitanga Beliteshaza, Hananiya kamwitanga Shadilaka, Mishaeli kamwitanga Meshaki na Azaliya niyo amwitanga Abedinego.<verse eid="DAN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 1:8" />Mna Danieli niyo ekamba hadye inkande ya chiseuta hegu kunywa divai anase kulemelwa mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile. Ivyo, niyo amlombeza uyo mkulu ywa masekulu amleke asekudya ivintu ivyo na kwejela uzavu mwe sila iyo. <verse eid="DAN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 1:9" />Elo, Zumbe Chohile niyo amtenda Ashipenazi uyo mkulu ywa wandima wa seuta amhingize na kumfila mbazi Danieli. <verse eid="DAN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 1:10" />Kwaviya Ashipenazi nendile akamogoha seuta, niyo amgamba Danieli, “Nna nkama kugamba sekulu ywangu seuta alavize malagizo mwe nkande ukungwa udye na vyo kunywa ukungwa uywe, nawone kugamba umwili wako wahwahwatila havikwinga weyawo mligane. Ivyo naniwambaze ujima wangu.”<verse eid="DAN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 1:11" />Elo, Danieli niyo ambasa mndima aikigwe ni sekulu ywa wandima wa seuta vileke awachimaile yeye Danieli na weyawe wakina Hananiya na Mishaeli na Azaliya amgamba, <verse eid="DAN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 1:12" />“Hampu chijeze suwe wandima wako kwa mazuwa mlongo kwa kuchinka mboga za mani chidye naho chinywe mazi. <verse eid="DAN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 1:13" />Ukaheza chiliganye suwe na awo wabwanga watuhu wakudya nkande ya seuta, ukaheza ulavye ulamuzi kuligana ne ivyo ukunga uwone.”<verse eid="DAN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 1:14" />Mchimaila uyo niyo evana nawo, niyo awajeze kwa mazuwa mlongo. <verse eid="DAN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 1:15" />Mazuwa ayo mlongo yeze yomboke, eze awakaule awo wabwanga wawoneka wadamana na kujimbala ukaleka wadya wandile wakadya inkande ya seuta. <verse eid="DAN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 1:16" />Ivyo, yudya mchimaila uyo niyo awaleka wajendeleze kudya mboga za mani ukaleka izinkande zikulavigwa ni seuta.<verse eid="DAN 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 1:17" />Chohile niyo awenka awo wabwanga wane umanyi no ubala mwe kumanya chila namna ya mawandiko na mahinyo. Ukaleka ayo Chohile kamwinka Danieli udahi wa kuhima ndege na kutapita sozi.<verse eid="DAN 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 1:18" />Uhelo we imihilimo iyo mitatu ikigwe ni seuta wize ubule, sekulu ywa wandima wa seuta niyo awegala wabwanga wose kulongozi kwa seuta Nebukadineza. <verse eid="DAN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 1:19" />Seuta niyo alonga nawo wose, niyo awona kugamba Danieli na Hananiya na Mishaeli na Azaliya wawajinka watuhu wose. Elo, niyo watenda wandima wa seuta. <verse eid="DAN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 1:20" />Mwe chila mbuli yo ubala na umanyi idya seuta awauzize wabwanga awo wane, kawawona mwenye kugamba wawagila nkanana mlongo ukaleka walangilizi na wagangana wose mo ulongozi wakwe. <verse eid="DAN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 1:21" />Danieli niyo asigala akasankana uko kwe dizumba dye chiseuta kubula mo mhilimo wa nkongo wo ulongozi wa seuta Koleshi.<verse eid="DAN 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DAN 2" />
  <para style="s">Sozi ya Nebukadineza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 2:1" />Momhilomo wa kaidi wo ulongozi wakwe, seuta Nebukadineza alotaga sozi, moyo wakwe niyo watenda na nkama vitendese, ivyo vyamhosa aswesa ntongo. <verse eid="DAN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 2:2" />Elo, seuta niyo alagiza wagangana na wahima ndega na wasai wa Wakalidayo waite kwakwe chani lufyambo lwe sozi yakwe. Wose niyo waita wakuchimala kulongozi kwakwe. <verse eid="DAN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 2:3" />Seuta Nebukadineza niyo awagamba, “Silota sozi, sozi iyo yaninka nkama, miye naunga nigambilwe lufyambo lwe sozi iyo.” <verse eid="DAN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 2:4" />Wadya Wakalidayo niyo wamhitula seuta kwa longa dya Chikalidayo, “Weye seuta wikalise kale na kale! Chitamwile isozi yako suwe chi wandima wako nachifyambule na kukugambila ulufyambo lwakwe.”<verse eid="DAN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 2:5" />Seuta niyo awagamba wantu awo, “Silavya milosi yangu kwa ukanuni, naunga mnigambile ulufyambo lwe sozi yenye ne imanakwe. Uneva mnadunduga kunigambila, nawakantani ivitago vyenyu chimwechimwe, ne izinyumba zenyu nazibogozolwe na kutenda madinda ya makandaluwa. <verse eid="DAN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 2:6" />Mna mnanigambila isozi iyo ne imanakwe, nawenkeni jeleko na ntunyo ikulise. Haluse nigambilani isozi iyo ne imanakwe!”<verse eid="DAN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 2:7" />Awo niyo wamhitula nkanana ya kaidi, “Seuta chigambile iyo isozi yako, suwe wandima wako nachikugambile iamanakwe.”<verse eid="DAN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 2:8" />Aho seuta niyo awagamba, “Simanya mwezulufya mwalonda luhenyo kwaviya mmanya silonga kale ulamuzi wangu. <verse eid="DAN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 2:9" />Uneva hamnanigambile isozi yangu ulamuzi nu mwenga du mwenyu. Mwivana vileke mnidantilize na kunibukila lulimi mkezulufya mwafanyanya navihitukile. Nigambila isozi iyo, miye nanimanye kugamba mwadaha kunivilikiza imanakwe.”<verse eid="DAN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 2:10" />Wadya Wakalidayo niyo wamhitula seuta “Muno mweisi hamna mntu yoyose akudaha kuchintiza viya weye ukunga. Iviya hahana seuta yoyose hata atende mkulu hegu mta nguvu zivivihi auzaga wagangana na walotezi hegu Wakalidayo mbuli saiyo. <verse eid="DAN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 2:11" />Mbuli ukuchuza, weye seuta ibuka udala. Hahana mntu akudaha kukuhitula mafani milungu du, iyo heikwila hamwenga na wantu.” <verse eid="DAN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 2:12" />Eze eve ivyo, seuta Nebukadineza niyo engila maya na kwihiwa vitendese, niyo awalagiza wagomba nkondo wawakome wata ubala wose wa Babeli. <verse eid="DAN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 2:13" />Elo, gong'ondo niyo dyatambaliswa kugamba wata ubala wose wakomwe, ivyo wantu niyo watumwa wakawalonde Danieli na weyawe nawo wakomwe.<verse eid="DAN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chohile amlagisa Danieli sozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 2:14" />Elo, Danieli kwa ubala na kukaulisa niyo aita akulonga na Alioko sekulu ywa wandima wa seuta uyo enkigwe lagizo dyo kuwakoma wata ubala wa Babeli. <verse eid="DAN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 2:15" />Danieli ni amuza uyo sekulu ywa wandima wa seuta, “Ni mbwani lagizo dya seuta dibuka ukali seivyo?” Aho, Alioko niyo amtambalisiza Danieli ulosi wose.<verse eid="DAN 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 2:16" />Aho, Danieli niyo ambasa seuta amlombeza amwinke mazuwa majeche vileke amgambile imana ye isozi yakwe. <verse eid="DAN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 2:17" />Vikaheza, Danieli niyo auya kukaya kwakwe akuwagambila weyawe imbuli iyo, Hananiya na Mishaeli na Azaliya. <verse eid="DAN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 2:18" />Kawagamba wamlombeze Zumbe Chohile ywa kwembingu awafile mbazi mo ulo ulufyambo, chani wanase kukomwa hamwenga na wata ubala watuhu wa Babeli. <verse eid="DAN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 2:19" />Nechilo icho, Danieli niyo alagiswa mwe uwoni lufyambo lwe isozi iyo. Danieli niyo amtogola Zumbe Chohile ywa kwembingu.<verse eid="DAN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 2:20" />Niyo agamba, “Zumbe Chohile atogolwe mazuwa yose hehena udumo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:20">Ubala na nguvu ni vyakwe.<verse eid="DAN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 2:21" />Uyo avitenda vintu vyose vitendeke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:21">awaika na kuwausa maseuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:21">nuyo akuwenka ubala na umanyi.<verse eid="DAN 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 2:22" />Abunkula mbuli za chinyele zefisize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:22">kamanya yadya yemwe chiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:22">kazungulukwa ni ulangazi.<verse eid="DAN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 2:23" />Nakutogola na kukutunya weye, Chohile ywa wakale wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:23">Weye kuninka ubala na udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:23">kunihitula amalombezo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:23">kunigambila cho kumhitula seuta.”<verse eid="DAN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Danieli amgambila seuta lufyambo lwe sozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 2:24" />Elo, Danieli niyo aita kwa Alioko uyo alagizwe ni seuta vileke awakome wata ubala wa Babeli, amgamba, “Usekuwakoma wata ubala wa Babeli, mna nigala miye kulongozi kwa seuta, miye nanimgambile imana ye sozi yakwe.”<verse eid="DAN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 2:25" />Elo, Alioko niyo asunguza kumwigala Danieli kulongozi kwa seuta amgamba, “Sekulu ywangu seuta, silondola mntu msiku mwa wantu wasamizizwe hano kulawa Yuda akudaha kukugambila isozi yako.” <verse eid="DAN 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 2:26" />Seuta niyo amuza Danieli, iviya zina dyakwe tuhu naketangwa Beliteshaza, “Togola wadaha kunigambila isozi nilotile ne imanakwe?”<verse eid="DAN 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 2:27" />Danieli niyo amhitula seuta, “Hahana mntu mta ubala hegu msai hegu mgangana hegu mhima ndege akudaha kukugambila lufyambo lwako. <verse eid="DAN 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 2:28" />Mna kwembingu kuna Chohile akudaha kubunkula lufyambo, uyo kakubunkwila, weye seuta Nebukadineza, mbuli zikunga zilaile mazuwa yakwiza. Sozi yako no uwoni vikwizile mo mtwi wako umo wendile kugona molusazi lwako ni vino.<verse eid="DAN 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 2:29" />Weye seuta, umo wendile kugona mo ulusazi lwakwo, nendile kwizilwa ni fanyanyi za mbuli nazilaile nyumani, Chohile uyo akubunkula lufyambo kakulagisa mbuli nazilaile. <verse eid="DAN 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 2:30" />Mna miye sibunkwilwe ulufyambo luno kwaviya nna ubala kujinka wantu watuhu wose, mna vileke weye seuta ugambilwe imana ye sozi yako na kumanya chiya chijinkile mwe izifanyanyi zako.<verse eid="DAN 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 2:31" />Weye seuta, mwe sozi yako kuwona tukulu dikulise, dina nguvu naho dyamweka vidala dichimala kulongozi kwako. Tukulu idyo nendile dikatisa vidala. <verse eid="DAN 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 2:32" />Mtwi we iditukulu idyo udamanywa kwa zahabu isuntigwe, chifuwa chakwe ne imikono yakwe vyendaga vya mayuwe ya chumbu, inda yakwe na amawambo yakwe nendile nivya shaba. <verse eid="DAN 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 2:33" />Viga vyakwe vyendaga vya chuma ne izinyayo zakwe nendile niza mhanganyo wa chuma na chilongo. <verse eid="DAN 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 2:34" />Umo wendile uchei ukakaula, yuwe kulu niyo dyang'oka dyenye kulawa ko lugulu hedikufigwe ni chintu chochose dyahonda iviga vye ishaba ne ichilongo vya diya iditukulu na kuvitula vihandehande. <verse eid="DAN 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 2:35" />Ahadya chiya ichuma ne ichilongo ne ishaba ne ichumbu ne izahabu vyose niyo vyatulika vihandehande vyatenda saviya makanka ya hantu hakuhetela uhule chipindi cha chizuwa. Mpeho niyo wavifilisiza hale hachisigale hata chihande chimwenga. Mna idiyuwe ditwile diya iditukulu niyo dyahituka lugulu lukulu lwamemeza isi yose.”<verse eid="DAN 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 2:36" />“Weye seuta sozi yako ni iyo. Haluse nakugambila imanakwe. <verse eid="DAN 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 2:37" />Weye seuta, weye wi seuta mkulu kujinka maseuta wose! Chohile kakwinka useuta na udahi na nguvu na ukulu! <verse eid="DAN 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 2:38" />Chohile kakwinka ulongozi mwa wantu wose na wanyama wose na wadege wose kokose kudya weli. Weye wi saviya udya umtwi we izahabu uwone! <verse eid="DAN 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 2:39" />Weye ukaheza nakwize useuta mtuhu, mna useuta uwo nautende usokela. Uwo nautimilwe ni useuta wa katatu uwo waliganywa saviya shaba, uwo naulongoze isi yose. <verse eid="DAN 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 2:40" />Seuta izo zikaheza nakwize useuta mtuhu wa kane utogile saviya chuma. Saviya chuma chikutula na kuhondahonda vintu vyose, nivyo useuta uwo ukunga use mbuli zose ze chiseuta zilongole. <verse eid="DAN 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 2:41" />Saviya uwone izinyayo na amadole nendile ni chilongo chokigwe ne inusu yendaga chuma. Ivyo ni kugamba useuta uwo nawepange, hata ivyo nautende na nguvu njeche za chuma saviya uwone chuma chihangane na chilongo. <verse eid="DAN 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 2:42" />Saviya uwone, madole yakwe ye iviga nusu nendile ni chuma na nusu nendaga ni chilongo, ivyo ni kugamba useuta uwo nautende na nguvu siku na usokezi msiku. <verse eid="DAN 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 2:43" />Saviya uwone chuma chihangana na chilongo. Ivyo ni kugamba vilongozi wo useuta uwo nawahangane kwa kusolana na wantu sawo we isi yako, mna hawadahe kuhangana saviya chuma hechikudaha kuhangana na chilongo. <verse eid="DAN 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 2:44" />Mwe ichipindi cha maseuta awo, Chohile ywa kwembingu naike useuta uwo haujeze kusigwa, hegu kuhudwa ni wantu wa si ntuhu. Useuta uwo nauzihonde na kuzusa iziseuta zilongole, useuta uwo wenye nawikale mazuwa yose. <verse eid="DAN 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 2:45" />Nakuwona yuwe disongoke kolugulu hedisongolwe ni mntu, yuwe diya ditwile vihandehande diya iditukulu didamanywe kwa chuma na shaba na chilongo na chumbu na zahabu. Weye seuta, Chohile Mkulu kakulagisa mbuli nazilaile nyumani. Miye sikutamwila isozi yako. Sozi yako niya chindedi ne imanakwe ivyo nivyo ili.”<verse eid="DAN 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta amjeleka Danieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DAN 2:46" />Aho, seuta Nebukadineza niyo afika madi uso wakwe wabula hasi kulongozi kwa Danieli kwa kumtunya na kulagiza kugamba wamlavize Danieli majeleko na ubani. <verse eid="DAN 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DAN 2:47" />Seuta Nebukadineza niyo amgamba Danieli, “Chindedi Chohile ywako ni Chohile Mkulu kujinka milungu yose naho ni Zumbe akulongoza maseuta wose, naho nuyo akubunkula lufyambo kwaviya kudaha kunifyambuila lufyambo luno.” <verse eid="DAN 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DAN 2:48" />Vikaheza, seuta Nebukadineza niyo amwinka Danieli ntunyo nkulu, kamwinka majeleko yalozize na kumtenda chilongozi mo mkowa wose wa Babeli na sekulu ywa wata ubala wose wa Babeli. <verse eid="DAN 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DAN 2:49" />Ukaleka mbuli izo, kwa lombezo dya Danieli seuta niyo awaika Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego watende wachimamaila wa mbuli zo ulongozi mo umkowa wa Babeli. Mna Danieli kasigala mo ukumbi we idizumba dye ichiseuta.<verse eid="DAN 2:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DAN 3" />
  <para style="s">Nebukadineza alagiza wantu wavikile tukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 3:1" />Seuta Nebukadineza kalagiza wantu wadamanya tukulu dya zahabu dina chimo cha futi milongo chenda na wangalamu wa futi chenda. Nendile kadichimalisa mwe dibwandasi dya Dula komkowa wa Babeli. <verse eid="DAN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 3:2" />Vikaheza seuta niyo awalagiza masekulu na wachimaila na wakulu we mikowa na walangilizi na wakukaula izimpamba na walamuzi na wata kukantila masa na masekulu watuhu wose we mikowa waite kwe ingasu yo kukonga kudivikila iditukulu idyo achimalise. <verse eid="DAN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 3:3" />Umo masekulu awo wechisanye ne kuchimala kulongozi kwe ditukulu chausa cho kukonga kudivikila. <verse eid="DAN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 3:4" />Mtowa lugong'ondo niyo atambalisa kwa izwi kulu, “Nyuwe wantu wa makabila yose ne izisi zose na malonga yose, mwalagizwa kugamba, <verse eid="DAN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 3:5" />aho namwivile izwi dya gunda hegu mluli hegu chisindamgunda hegu limba hegu vilangu hegu zeze na chimpandwa chochose cha wila, mwaungwa mfike madi hasi na kudivikila iditukulu dye izahabu dichimaliswe ni seuta Nebukadineza. <verse eid="DAN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 3:6" />Mntu yoyose hanafikile madi hasi na kudivikila nasunguze kudulwa mwe tanuli dina moto ukwakisa.” <verse eid="DAN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 3:7" />Elo, wantu wose hadya weze weve maizwi ya magunda na mluli na chisindamgunda na limba na vilangu na zeze na chimpandwa chochose cha wila niyo wagwa chifudifudi wadivikila diya iditukulu dichimaliswe ni seuta Nebukadineza.<verse eid="DAN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wambuyaze dya Danieli walahwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 3:8" />Ichipindi icho, Wakalidayo wasiku niyo welaviza wawalaha Wayahudi. <verse eid="DAN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 3:9" />Wamgambila seuta Nebukadineza, “Weye seuta wikale mazuwa yose! <verse eid="DAN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 3:10" />Weye seuta nakulavya lagizo kugamba chila mntu akeva izwi dya gunda na mluli na chisindamgunda na zeze na limba na vilangu na chila chimpandwa cha wila, afike madi hasi na kudivikila diya iditukulu dye izahabu, <verse eid="DAN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 3:11" />na kugamba mntu yoyose hekwinama hasi na kudivikila idyo iditukulu asunguze kudulwa mndani mwe tanuli dina moto ukwakisa. <verse eid="DAN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 3:12" />Haluse kuna Wayahudi wasiku usagule wasankane mwe izimbuli zo ulongozi wo umkowa wa Babeli, kugamba Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego, weye seuta awantu awo hawatimile idilagizo dyako. Walememela kuisankanila imilungu yako na kudivikila diya iditukulu dye izahabu uchimalise.”<verse eid="DAN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 3:13" />Aho, seuta Nebukadineza akatenda kemukwa maya niyo alagiza kugamba Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego wegalwe kulongozi kwakwe. Niyo wegalwa kulongozi kwa seuta Nebukadineza. <verse eid="DAN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 3:14" />Seuta Nebukadineza niyo awauza, “Togolani, ni chindedi kugamba weye Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego mlemela kuisankanila imilungu yangu na kudivikila diya iditukulu dye zahabu nichimalise? <verse eid="DAN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 3:15" />Elo, aho namwivile vituhu izwi dya gunda na mluli na chisindamgunda na zeze na limba na vilangu na chila chimpandwa chituhu chochose cha wila, togolani mwemalanya kufika madi hasi na kudivikila iditukulu nidamanye? Uneva mnalemela namsunguze kudulwa mwe tanuli dikwakisa moto. Togolani ni mnungu yuhi akudaha kuwambulani kulawa mwezinguvu zangu?”<verse eid="DAN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 3:16" />Elo, Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego niyo wamhitula seuta, “Weye Nebukadineza suwe hachikunga kwekanila mwako mwe imbuli ino. <verse eid="DAN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 3:17" />Hegu nivyo, Chohile ywetu uyo chikumsankanila adaha kuchambula mwe iditanuli dyo moto ukwakisa, naho nachambule mwe izinguvu zako, weye seuta. <verse eid="DAN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 3:18" />Mna hatahegu hanachambule, sekulu ywangu seuta, uvimanye kugamba suwe hachisankanile milungu yako hegu kuvikila iditukulu dye izahabu uchimalise.”<verse eid="DAN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wambuyaze dya Danieli wakantilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 3:19" />Aho, seuta Nebukadineza niyo emukiswa ni maya, sula yakwe ihitukila kwa maya kwachausa cha kuweihiwa Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego. Niyo alagiza iditanuli dikonkonywe moto nkanana mfungate kujinkaviya vizweleke. <verse eid="DAN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 3:20" />Niyo alagiza wantu wasiku wata nguvu vitendese mwe idibunga dya awagomba nkondo wakwe wawanyinye Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego na kuwadula mndani mwe diya iditanuli dikwakisa moto. <verse eid="DAN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 3:21" />Elo, wabwanga awo niyo wanyinywa kuno wavala majuba yawo ne izinkazu zawo ne viemba vyao na suche ntuhu, niyo wadulwa mwe diya iditanuli dikwakisa moto. <verse eid="DAN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 3:22" />Kwaviya idilagizo dya seuta dyendaga kali, moto nendile ujimbwa utendesa mkali vyahosa mpungile yo moto niyo yawakoma wadya wantu wawegale Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego. <verse eid="DAN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 3:23" />Aho, Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego kuno wakatenda wanyinywa wadulwa kundani kwe diya iditanuli dikwakisa moto.<verse eid="DAN 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 3:24" />Chipumpa, seuta Nebukadineza niyo ehelwa, vyaleka asunguza kwinuka awauza awalangilizi wakwe, “Togolani, hachinyinyize wantu watatu na kuwadula mo umoto?” Awo niyo wamhitula, “Seuta heye! Seivyo.!”<verse eid="DAN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 3:25" />Seuta niyo auza, “Mna haluse ni mbwani nawona wantu wane wakujendajenda umo mo umoto hawanyinyigwe naho hawahwele, naho umntu ywa kane awoneka saviya mwana ywa milungu?”<verse eid="DAN 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wabwanga awo watatu walekeilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 3:26" />Elo, seuta Nebukadineza niyo asogeila umlomo we iditanuli dikwakisa moto, etenga, “Shedilaki, Meshaki, Abedinego, wandima wa Chohile Mkulu, fosani mwize hano!” Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego niyo wafosa mudya mo umoto. <verse eid="DAN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 3:27" />Masekulu na wachimaila na wakulu we mikowa na awalangilizi wa seuta, wose niyo wadugana na kuwazunguluka, wawona kugamba udya umoto udunduga kuwoka wadya awabwanga awatatu. Fili zawo hazihyele, suche zawo hazihyele naho hawana mpofa yoyose ya moto.<verse eid="DAN 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 3:28" />Elo, seuta Nebukadineza niyo agamba, “Atogolwe Chohile ywa Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego kwaviya katuma mndima ywakwe ywa kwembingu na kuwambula wandima wakwe awo wakumwikiya msuhi. Awo walemele kutimila lagizo dyangu dya chiseuta niyo wasagula kubanika ukaleka kuvikila milungu mituhu, mna Chohile ywawo uyodu. <verse eid="DAN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 3:29" />Elo, nalagiza kugamba wantu wa kabila dyodyose na si yoyose na longa dyodyose nawalonge mbuli yoyose ihiye mwa Chohile ywa Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego nawanyofolwe ivitago vyawo chimwechimwe ne izinyumba zawo nazibogozolwe. Kwaviya hahana mnungu mtuhu akudaha kwambula savino.”<verse eid="DAN 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 3:30" />Elo, seuta Nebukadineza niyo awongeza ukulu Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego mo mkowa wa Babeli.<verse eid="DAN 3:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DAN 4" />
  <para style="s">Sozi ya kaidi ya seuta Nebukadineza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 4:1" />“Miye seuta Nebukadineza nawawandikila wantu wa amakabila yose na awantu we izisi zose na awantu wa chila longa wakwikala mwe isi yose. Mtende na utondowazi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 4:1">“Ndamsa! <verse eid="DAN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 4:2" />Siwona ni vyedi niwagambileni vilagiso na maula nilagiswe ni Chohile Mkulu.”<verse eid="DAN 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 4:3" />“Kaula ivyo vili vikulu vilagiso vyakwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:3">Maula yakwe yana nguvu vitendese!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:3">Useuta wakwe ni wamazuwa yose, ulongozi wakwe wekalisa cheleko na cheleko.”<verse eid="DAN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 4:4" />“Miye Nebukadineza nendile hekala kwedizumba dyangu dye chiseuta kwa mbwedo na kuchumilwa. <verse eid="DAN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 4:5" />Mna niyo nalota sozi intisize. Hatenda sigona mo ulusazi lwangu, fanyanyi na uwoni momtwi wangu vinitisa. <verse eid="DAN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 4:6" />Elo, niyo nalagiza wata umanyi wose wa Babeli waletwe kulongozi kwangu vileke wanigambile isozi iyo yagaze. <verse eid="DAN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 4:7" />Umo wagangana na walotezi na Wakalidayo na wahima ndege weze wabule niyo nawatamwila isozi yangu, mna wadunduga kunigambila imana yakwe. <verse eid="DAN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 4:8" />Nyumani niyo eza Danieli iviya kwa zina dya mnungu ywangu etangwa Beliteshaza, uyo muye wa milungu ikukile wekala mndani mwakwe. Miye niyo namtamwila isozi yangu, namgamba, <verse eid="DAN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 4:9" />weye Beliteshaza, sekulu ywa wagangana, sivimanya kugamba muye wa milungu ikukile wekala mndani mwako naho hahana lufyambo lolose ludala mwako. Ino niyo isozi yangu hake nigambila imana yakwe.<verse eid="DAN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 4:10" />Umo nagonile siwona uwoni uno, siwona mti mtali vitendese hagatigati he isi. <verse eid="DAN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 4:11" />Udya umti ujendeleza kukulana kutogesa, ntambilanga yakwe niyo yabula kwembingu. Nendile ukadaha kuwoneka kulawa chila hantu mweisi. <verse eid="DAN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 4:12" />Mani yakwe nendile ni matana. Nendile umema ntunda zikuchinta vintu vyose mweisi. Wanyama wose wa kumbago wapata chizuli hasi hakwe, wadege mo ulanga nendile wakekala mwa amatambi yakwe. Chila chumbe nendile chikadya kulaila mo umti uwo.”<verse eid="DAN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 4:13" />“Umo hafanyanya uwoni uwo, niyo nawona mwamaizi akukile alawa kwembingu asela hasi. <verse eid="DAN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 4:14" />Niyo alonga kwa izwi kulu akagamba, Kantani uno umti, amatambi yakwe myasesenge. Hulubulani amani yakwe ne izintunda zakwe zimwaganiseni. Wanyama wasumke hasi hakwe na wadege wapuluke wamlawe mwa amatambi yakwe. <verse eid="DAN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 4:15" />Mna idisiki dyakwe na amaizi vilekeni dikatenda dinyinywa kwa mnyolo wa chuma na shaba disigaile mwe isanga mwa amani ya kwenkonde.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 4:15">“ ‘Mlekeni uyo mntu achabazwe ni mnyuzu wa kwembingu, mlekeni ekale hamwenga na wanyama wa kumbago na kudya mani koluwala. <verse eid="DAN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 4:16" />Akili yakwe ihitwilwe kulawa ya chimntu itende ya mnyama kwa mihilimo mfungate. <verse eid="DAN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 4:17" />Ulamuzi uwo utambaliswa ni wandima wa kwembingu, ulamuzi ulamulwa ni wakukile, vileke wantu wose chila hantu wabunkule kugamba Chohile Mkulu ana udahi mwe ziseuta zose za awantu, uyo amwinka useuta mntu yoyose akunga, amtenda seuta hata mntu ahwelese ywa udumo.’ ” <verse eid="DAN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 4:18" />“Iyo niyo isozi nilotile miye Nebukadineza. Haluse weye Beliteshaza nigambila imana yakwe, kwaviya hahana hata mntu yumwenga mwa wata umanyi wose mo useuta wangu akudaha kunigambila imana yakwe, mna weye wadaha kunigambila kwaviya muye wa milungu ikukile wekala mndani mwako.”<verse eid="DAN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Danieli alavyanya isozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 4:19" />Ahadya, Danieli, iviya nendile aketangwa Beliteshaza niyo anda kukangawala, fanayanyi zakwe zimholoza. Seuta niyo amgamba, “Beliteshaza, sozi ino ne imana yakwe visekukuholoza!” Beliteshaza niyo amhitula, “Sekulu ywangu hegu isozi ino ne imanakwe vyawalangile awankondo wako!” <verse eid="DAN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 4:20" />Mti uwone ukula na kutogesa, uwo amatambi yakwe ni matali yabula kwembingu, uwo uwoneka chila hantu mwe isi, <verse eid="DAN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 4:21" />mani yakwe yakatenda ni matana ne izintunda zakwe zilozize za kulisa ivyumbe vyose, wanyama wa kumbago wekala hasi he ichizuli chakwe na wadega wo ulanga nawakazenga masasa mlanga mwa amatambi yakwe.<verse eid="DAN 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 4:22" />Weye seuta mti udya ni weye utendile mkulu na mta nguvu. Ukulu wako ubula kwembingu na useuta wako uzagala kubula uhelo we isi. <verse eid="DAN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 4:23" />Vikaheza, weye seuta niyo wawona vituhu, mwamizi akukile akasela kulawa kwembingu, niyo alagiza, Ukanteni uno umti na kuukoma. Mna idisiki dyakwe na amaizi yakwe vyaseni mwe isanga mwa amani maisi ya kwenkonde dikatenda dinyinywa aho kwa mnyolo wa chuma na shaba. Mlekeni uyo umntu achabazwe ni mnyuzu wa kwembingu, mlekeni ekale hamwenga na awanyama wa kumbago kwa mihilimo mfungate.<verse eid="DAN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 4:24" />“Elo, weye seuta ino niyo imana ye isozi yako, dino ni lagizo alagize Chohile Mkulu mwako weye sekulu ywangu. <verse eid="DAN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 4:25" />Weye nobalazizwe hale na wantu! Nawikale hamwenga na wanyama wa kumbago, nodye mani saviya ng'ombe nochabazwe ni mnyuzu wo ulanga. Nawikale seivyo kwa mihilimo mfungate, na uhelo naubunkule kugamba Chohile Mkulu nuyo mta udahi mwa iziseuta za awantu naho amwinka useuta mntu yoyose akusagula. <verse eid="DAN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 4:26" />Lagizo dya kusigaza idisiki na amaizi ya uwo umti mwe isanga ni kugamba, Weye novuzizwe vituhu useuta wako aho nomanyize kugamba Chohile ywa kwembingu nuyo akulongoza. <verse eid="DAN 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 4:27" />Elo, weye seuta kwetegeleze ulangilizi wangu. Leka masa yako na wavu wako udamanye mbuli zikuwagila na kuwafila mbazi wakubunyanywa, vyadahika chipindi chako cha kuchumilwa nachongezwe.”<verse eid="DAN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 4:28" />Mbuli zose izo niyo zamlaila seuta Nebukadineza. <verse eid="DAN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 4:29" />Mhilimo umwenga nyumani, seuta Nebukadineza nendile akajenda mlanga mwe idihala dye idizumba dyakwe dye ichiseuta dyo umzi wa Babeli, <verse eid="DAN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 4:30" />elo, niyo agamba, “Kaula mzi mkulu wa Babeli nizengile kwa nguvu zangu utende wikazi wangu wa chiseuta na kwachausa cha ntogozi zangu!” <verse eid="DAN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 4:31" />Ahadya eze alonge imilosi iyo, izwi kulawa kwembingu niyo dyagamba, “Weye seuta Nebukadineza, kwetegeleze ulosi uno ukukulanga weye kuhokwa useuta wako. <verse eid="DAN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 4:32" />Nobalazizwe hale na wantu ukekale hamwenga na wanyama wa kumbago koluwala naho nodye mani saviya ngo'mbe. Nawikale seivyo kwa mihilimo mfungate, na uhelo nomanye kugamba Chohile Mkulu nuyo mta udahi mwe iziseuta zose za awantu, naho amwinka useuta mntu yoyose akusagula.”<verse eid="DAN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 4:33" />Ahadya mbuli iyo mwa seuta Nebukadineza niyo yajeswa. Kabalazizwa hale na wantu niyo atenda adya mani saviya ng'ombe. Kachabazwa ni mnyuzu wa kwembingu, izifili zakwe niyo zanyafulika saviya mazoya ya gushu na makombe yakwe yatenda saviya ya ngwilizi.<verse eid="DAN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nebukadineza amtogola Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 4:34" />“Mo uhelo we idya imihilimo mfungate, miye Nebukadineza, sinula ameso yangu nasinya kulanga kwembingu, akili zangu niyo zaniwiya. Aho niyo namtogola Chohile Mkulu na kumtunya uyo akwikala mazuwa yose.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:34">“Ulongozi wakwe ni wamazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:34">na useuta wakwe wekalisa kulawa cheleko kubula cheleko.”<verse eid="DAN 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 4:35" />Wantu wose mwe isi sicho chintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:35">wandima wa kwembingu na wantu mwe isi we hasi ho ulongozi wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:35">Hahana akudaha kumhiga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:35">hegu kumuza, Watenda mbwani?<verse eid="DAN 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 4:36" />“Umo nize nivuzizwe iziakili zangu, iviya niyo navuzizwa ntunyo yangu na ugoli wangu na ukulu wangu na useuta wangu. Walangilizi wangu na masekulu wa awandima wangu niyo weza kunilonda, niyo navuzwa mo useuta wangu na kwinkwa ntunyo saviya nkongo.”<verse eid="DAN 4:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 4:37" />“Haluse miye Nebukadineza namtogola na kumkuza na kumtunya seuta ywa kwembingu. Kwaviya ntendwa zakwe zose zawagila naho awaseleza wakweduvya.”<verse eid="DAN 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DAN 5" />
  <para style="s">Belishaza agoneka wantu kwe nkande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 5:1" />Zuwa dimwenga seuta Belishaza agonekaga masekulu wa wandima wakwe walozize wakubula maelufu niyo adya nawo nkande na kunywa divai hamwenga nawo. <verse eid="DAN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 5:2" />Umo Belishaza akanywa idivai yakwe, niyo alagiza egailwe viya ivikombe vye zahabu na vye chumbu ivyo ise Nebukadineza aguhaga kulawa mwe Inyumba ya Chohile ya Yelusalemu, vileke seuta na masekulu awo na wakazize na wasuntaviya wakwe wavijeseze mo kunywela. <verse eid="DAN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 5:3" />Elo, viya vye zahabu ne vye chumbu viguhigwe kwe Inyumba ya Chohile uko Yelusalemu niyo vyegalwa. Seuta na masekulu na wasuntaviya wakwe wavijeseza mo ukunywela. <verse eid="DAN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 5:4" />Wanywa kuno watogola milungu yawo idamanywe kwa zahabu na mayuwe ya chumbu na shaba na chuma na miti na mayuwe.<verse eid="DAN 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 5:5" />Ahadya madole ya chigasa cha mntu niyo yalaila na kuwandika mwe ilipu ye ichiwambaza che idizumba dye ichiseuta hajihi ne ichiya cho kwikiya izita hantu hamulikwe vyedi. Seuta kawona umkono uwo umo ukawandika. <verse eid="DAN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 5:6" />Elo, uso wa seuta niyo wahitukila ilangi na fanyanyi zakwe zimholoza, vitago vyakwe vilegela na amavindi yakwe yakonga kuzingiza. <verse eid="DAN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 5:7" />Seuta Belishaza niyo alagiza wagangana na Wakalidayo wata umanyi na walotezi wegalwe kwakwe. Weze wegalwe seuta niyo awagamba awo wata ubala wa Babeli, “Mntu yoyose akunga adahe kusoma yano amawandiko na kunigambila imana yakwe, naviswe suche za langi ya zambalau na kuviswa mkufu wa zahabu mwe isingo yakwe na kwinkigwa hantu ha katatu mo ulongozi we chiseuta.” <verse eid="DAN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 5:8" />Elo, wata umanyi wose wa seuta niyo waita kulongozi kwakwe mna wadunduga kuyasoma yadya amawandiko na kumgambila imana yakwe. <verse eid="DAN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 5:9" />Ivo, seuta Belishaza niyo ajendeleza kumema nkama ilangi yo uso wakwe ihitukila vitendese, amasekulu wakwe nawo wakangawala.<verse eid="DAN 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 5:10" />Nine dya seuta eze eve ulwasu lwa seuta na masekulu wa awandima wa seuta niyo engila ko uwa we ngasu, agamba, “Weye seuta wikalise kale na kale! Fanyanyi zako zise kukuholoza na kuhitukila ilangi yako. <verse eid="DAN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 5:11" />Mo useta wako mna mntu uyo muye wa milungu ikukile wimndani mwakwe. Mo ulongozi wa iso, mntu uyo kabunkuka kugamba ni mntu mta akili na umanyi ubala saviya milungu. Iso seuta Nebukadineza amtendaga sekulu ywa wagangana na walotezi na Wakalidayo wata ubala na wahima ndege. <verse eid="DAN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 5:12" />Kwaviya ana muye wedi na fanyanyi na umanyi wa kufyambula sozi na kufyambula lufyambo na kusa makunto madala. Zina dya uyo umntu ni Danieli, iso nakamwitanga Beliteshaza, mwitange uyo nakugambile imana ya amawandiko yano.”<verse eid="DAN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Danieli atapita mawandiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 5:13" />Elo, Danieli niyo egalwa kulongozi kwa seuta, seuta niyo amuza, “Togola, niweye Danieli, yumwe ywa awantu watahigwe waletigwe ni tate seuta kulawa kweisi ya Yuda? <verse eid="DAN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 5:14" />Siva kugamba milungu ikukile ikwinka udahi we ichedu wa umanyi na akili na ubala mwe kukombaganya vintu vilozize. <verse eid="DAN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 5:15" />Wantu wata ubala na wagangana weze waletwe hano hangu vileke wanisomele na kunigambila imana ya yano amawandiko wadunduga. <verse eid="DAN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 5:16" />Haluse, siva kugamba weye wadaha kutambalisa lufyambo na mbuli zefisize. Haluse unadaha kusoma yano amawandiko na kunigambila imana yakwe, noviswe suche za langi ya zambalau na kuviswa mkufu wa zahabu mwe isingo yako. Nowinkigwe luhenyo lwa katatu mo ukulu wo useuta uno.”<verse eid="DAN 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 5:17" />Danieli niyo amhitula seuta Belishaza, “Majeleko yako sigala nayo mwenye hegu mwinke mntu mtuhu. Hata ivyo miye nahusomele ayo amawandiko na kukugambila imana yakwe.”<verse eid="DAN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 5:18" />“Weye seuta, Chohile Mkulu amwinkaga iso Nebukadineza, useuta na ukulu na ntogozi na ntunyo. <verse eid="DAN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 5:19" />Kwachausa cho ukulu amwinkile, wantu wose wa makabila na wantu we izisi zose na wantu wa amalonga yose wazingiza na kumogoha. Nebukadineza adahaga kukoma mntu yoyose aungile na kumwasa na ujima mntu yoyose aungile. Aungile kumkweza mo ulongozi kamkweza, kamseleza mo ulongozi yudya aungile kumseleza. <verse eid="DAN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 5:20" />Mna, eze akonge kwefyenya na kutenda na moyo mdala na kweduvya, niyo auswa. <verse eid="DAN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 5:21" />Niyo abalazizwa hale na wantu, akili yakwe itendwa saviya ya mnyama, niyo ekala hamwenga na mpunda za kwenyika, kadya mani saviya ng'ombe, kachabazwa ni mnyuzu wa kwembingu kubula abunkula kugamba Chohile Mkulu nuyo akulongoza iziseuta zose za awantu, uyo amwika seuta mntu yoyose akusagula.”<verse eid="DAN 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 5:22" />Mna weye mwanawe, weye Belishaza hunyanyahale hata hegu izimbuli zose izo kuzimanya. <verse eid="DAN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 5:23" />Hantu hakwe kweduvya mwenye mwa Zumbe ywa kwembingu. Kwigailwa ivikombe vye Inyumba ya Chohile na kuvijeseza kunywela divai weye na amasekulu na wakazizo na wasuntaviya wako na kuitogola milungu idamanywe kwa chumbu na zahabu na shaba na chuma na miti na mayuwe matuhu, milungu iyo heikuwona hegu kwiva hegu kumanya mbuli yoyose. Mna, humtunyize Chohile uyo akukwinka ujima na chila mbuli ukudamanya imanyika kulongozi kwakwe. <verse eid="DAN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 5:24" />Nivyo vikuleka Chohile kegala mkono uwandike amawandiko yano.<verse eid="DAN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 5:25" />“Milosi iwandikwe ni ino, ‘MENE, MENE, TEKELI NA PELESI’ <verse eid="DAN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 5:26" />Imana yakwe ni ino, MENE, ni kugamba Chohile kawaza amazuwa yo useuta wako na kuusa. <verse eid="DAN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 5:27" />TEKELI, weye kuhimwa mwe chihimo, kuwoneka kugamba huna uzami wowose. <verse eid="DAN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 5:28" />PELESI, ni kugamba, useuta wako usangwa wenkigwa Waamedi na Wapelisi.”<verse eid="DAN 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 5:29" />Ahadya, seuta Belishaza niyo alagiza Kugamba, Danieli aviswe suche za langi ya zambalau na mkufu wa zahabu mwe singo yakwe. Niyo vyatambaliswa kugamba Danieli natoze hantu ha luhenyo lwa katatu mo useuta. <verse eid="DAN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 5:30" />Ichilo icho, seuta Belishaza ywa Wakalidayo niyo akomwa, <verse eid="DAN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 5:31" />na Dalilo mntu kulawa Medi niyo atenda seuta akatenda na mihilimo milongo mtandatu na midi.<verse eid="DAN 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DAN 6" />
  <para style="s">Danieli mndani mwe bome dya simba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 6:1" />Seuta Dalio kaunga kusagula masekulu gana dimwenga na milongo midi wawambize ndima mo ulongozi wakwe. <verse eid="DAN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 6:2" />Iviya kasagula masekulu watatu, Danieli nendile ni yumwenga mwa awo wawachimaile wadya masekulu watuhu kwachausa cha chongezeko cha seuta anasekubunyanywa. <verse eid="DAN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 6:3" />Elo, Danieli niyo asunguza ebunkula kugamba awagila ukaleka wadya wachimaila watuhu na masekulu wose kwaviya endaga na muye wedi. Elo, seuta niyo afanyanya amwinke ukulu wa kuwachimaila weyawe wose mo useuta wakwe. <verse eid="DAN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 6:4" />Wadya awachimaila hamwenga na masekulu niyo walonda luhosa lwa kumlaha Danieli mwe mbuli zo useuta, mna hawawone luhosa lwa kumlaha hegu ubanasi wowose, kwaviya Danieli endaga mkanuni. Hawoneka na ubanasi hegu mlema wowose. <verse eid="DAN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 6:5" />Uhelo wakwe niyo wevana kugamba, “Hachipate luhosa lolose lwa kumlaha Danieli ukaleka mbuli zikulanga sigilizi ya Chohile ywakwe.”<verse eid="DAN 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 6:6" />Elo, wachimaila awo na masekulu chahamwenga niyo wambasa seuta Dalio wamgamba, “Wikalise mazuwa yose weye seuta Dalio! <verse eid="DAN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 6:7" />Suwe wakulu usagule na masekulu na wachimaila na walangilizi na wakulu we mikowa, chose chivana kugamba vyawagila, weye seuta ulavye lagizo naumanyise kugamba dyatimilwa kwa ukanuni. Lagiza kugamba kwa mazuwa milongo mitatu kusekutenda na mntu yoyose akunga alekelwe kulombeza chintu chochose kwa mnungu yoyose hegu kwa mntu yoyose, ukaleka kulawa kwako weye, weye seuta. Mntu yoyose nahige idilagizo dino adulwe mwe idibome dye zisimba. <verse eid="DAN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 6:8" />Haluse, weye seuta Dalio, lavya idilagizo idyo naho udijele hula dyako mwenye vileke dinasekuhituilwa. Idyo naditende ni lagizo dya Wamedi na Wapelisi, lagizo idyo hadihituilwe.” <verse eid="DAN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 6:9" />Elo, seuta Dalio niyo ajela hula dyakwe mwa amawandiko ye isigilizi iyo. <verse eid="DAN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 6:10" />Danieli eze amanye kugamba idya ibaluwa ijelwa hula, niyo auya kwenyumba yakwe kwegolofa mwe ichumba chendile na madilisha yavuguke kuhinga Yelusalemu. Umo Danieli saviya vili mazwela yakwe, kafika madi nkanana ntatu chila zuwa akamlombeza na kumtogola Chohile ywakwe.<verse eid="DAN 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 6:11" />Wadya awantu wadamanye umwalo mwa Danieli niyo wengila kunyumba wambwila Danieli alombeza na kumtogola Chohile ywakwe chani amwambize. <verse eid="DAN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 6:12" />Elo, wantu awo niyo waita kwa seuta wamgambila milosi ya kumlaha Danieli, wakajeseza idya idilagizo, wakagamba, “Seuta Dalio, togola weye hujeile hula mwe ibaluwa ye idilagizo kugamba kwa mazuwa milongo mitatu hahana mntu yoyose nalekeilwe kulombeza chintu chochose, kwa mnungu yoyose ukaleka kulawa kwako du weye seuta, na kugamba mntu yoyose nahige idilagizo dino adulwe mwe idibome dye izisimba?” Seuta niyo ahitula, “Ivyo nivyo dili idilagizo, kuligana na Wamedi na Wapelizi, iyo haikudaha kuhituilwa.” <verse eid="DAN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 6:13" />Awo niyo wamgambila seuta, “Yudya Danieli yumwenga ywa wantu waguhigwe kulawa kweisi ya Yuda hakutunyize weye seuta naho hatimile idilagizo ujeile hula. Uyo alombeza nkanana ntatu chila zuwa.”<verse eid="DAN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 6:14" />Seuta eze eve iyo imilosi niyo engila chinyulu vitendese. Kahikiliza vitendese vileke apate sila ya kumhonya Danieli. Kajeza kuhikiliza kubula zuwa dyahunga. <verse eid="DAN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 6:15" />Wadya wantu chahamwenga niyo wambasa seuta wamgamba, “Weye seuta kumbuka kugamba hahana sigilizi yoyose hegu lagizo dyodyose dya Wamedi na Wapelizi dikudaha kuhitulwa dinaheza kwikwa ni seuta.”<verse eid="DAN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 6:16" />Ahadya, seuta Dalio niyo alavya lagizo, wantu awo niyo wamwigala wakumdula kwe idibome dye zisimba. Seuta niyo amgamba Danieli, “Chohile ywako ukumsankanila mazuwa yose nakuhonye.” <verse eid="DAN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 6:17" />Yuwe niyo dyegalwa na kusitwa mo umlomo we diya idibome. Seuta niyo aditowa hula dyakwe mwenye na wadya masekulu nawo watowa mahula yawo chani ulamuzi mwa Danieli usekuhituilwa. <verse eid="DAN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 6:18" />Vikaheza seuta niyo auya kwe idizumba dyakwe dye chiseuta umo kacheleza hadile nkande, hadamanye ngasu yoyose. Kengila chinkungulu chilo chose.<verse eid="DAN 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 6:19" />Mtondo, chilochilo, seuta Dalio niyo enuka asunguza kwita kwe idibome dye izisimba. <verse eid="DAN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 6:20" />Eze abule hajihi na diya idibome kamwitanga Danieli kwa izwi diholole, “Danieli, mndima ywa Chohile mta ujima! Togola, Chohile ywako ukusankanila mazuwa yose kadaha kuzichinda izisimba zisekukudya?”<verse eid="DAN 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 6:21" />Danieli niyo amhitula seuta, “Weye seuta wikale mazuwa yose! <verse eid="DAN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 6:22" />Chohile ywangu kegala wandima wakwe wa kwembingu wanyinye imilomo ya zino izisimba, nazo hazinidamanye dyodyose. Kadamanya ivyo kwaviya kamanya kugamba miye sina mlema wowose kwakwe naho sikoile masa kwako.” <verse eid="DAN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 6:23" />Aho, seuta niyo elelwa vitendese, niyo alagiza kugamba Danieli alavigwe mwe idibome. Elo, niyo wamlavya, uyo nendile halumizwe hata hadodo, kwaviya wikazi wakwe wose kamwikiya msuhi Chohile ywakwe. <verse eid="DAN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 6:24" />Seuta niyo alagiza wadya wantu wamzigilize Danieli wagwilwe, awo niyo wadulwa mndani mwe diya idibome dye izisimba hamwenga na wavyele wawo na awana wawo. Umo hewenati kuduma hasi, izisimba ziwapwela na kuwatagantiza amavuha yawo.<verse eid="DAN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 6:25" />Vikaheza, seuta Dalio niyo awawandikila wantu wa makabila yose ne izisi zose na amalonga yose.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 6:25">Nawaungila utondowazi utendese! <verse eid="DAN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 6:26" />Nalavya lagizo kugamba wantu wose chila hantu mo useuta wangu wamogohe na kumtunya Chohile ywa Danieli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:26">“Uyo ni Chohile mta ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:26">Uyo nalongoze mazuwa yose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:26">Useuta wakwe haukudaha kubalangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:26">udahi wakwe hauna udumo.<verse eid="DAN 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 6:27" />Uyo ambula na kuhonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:27">uyo adamanya maula na mpituko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:27">kwembingu na mweisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:27">Kamhonya Danieli kulawa mwe kukomwa ni simba.”<verse eid="DAN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 6:28" />Elo, Danieli niyo achumilwa mwe ichipindi cho ulongozi wa seuta Dalio na mo useuta wa seuta Koleshi ywa Pelishi.<verse eid="DAN 6:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DAN 7" />
  <para style="s">Sozi ya Danieli ya makala mane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 7:1" />Mo mhilimo wa nkongo wo ulongozi wa seuta Belishaza ywa Babeli, Danieli akatenda kagona molusazi lwekwe alotaga sozi na kuwona uwoni. Niyo awandika izimbuli awone mwe isozi yakwe. <verse eid="DAN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 7:2" />Miye Danieli, nechilo siwona uwoni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 7:2">Nkung'unto kulawa ntendele nne ze isi zitibula ibahali inkulu. <verse eid="DAN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 7:3" />Makala mane makulu chila dimwenga dyesimana ne dituhu yasolokela umo mwe bahali. <verse eid="DAN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 7:4" />Kala dya nkongo diwoneka saviya simba naho nendile dina mawawa saviya ngwilizi. Umo hadikaula, mawawa yakwe niyo yahasulwa, idyo dinulwa na kuchimaliswa kwa viga vidi saviya mntu. Vikaheza niyo enkigwa akili enga za mntu.<verse eid="DAN 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 7:5" />Kala dya kaidi dyawoneka saviya kala dikwitangwa dubu idyo ntendele ye iviga vyakwe inukila. Mo umlomo wakwe endaga na mbavu ntatu zifundigwe mwa ameno yakwe. Izwi niyo dyamgamba, “Hake dya nyama ilozize ivyo ukudaha!”<verse eid="DAN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 7:6" />Ivyo vikaheza, niyo nawona kala tuhu. Idyo dyawoneka saviya suwi ina mawawa mane ya wadege mlanga mo umgongo wakwe. Mnyama uyo endaga na mitwi mine. Uyo niyo enkwa udahi wa kulongoza.<verse eid="DAN 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 7:7" />Idyo dikaheza, mo uwoni wangu uwo wa nechilo niyo nawona kala dya kane dikwehela dikutisisa. Dyendaga na meno makulu ya chuma kayajeseza kudya na kutagantiza, visigaile divijatajata kwa mafumba yakwe. Idyo dyesimana na yadya amakala amatuhu amatatu, kwaviya dyendaga na mahembe mlongo. <verse eid="DAN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 7:8" />Umo nichei hakaula ayo amahembe, niyo nawona kahembe katuhu kahota mwe yadya amatuhu mlongo. Mahemba matatu ya nkongo niyo yahasulwa vileke yalavye luhenyo mwa ako akahembe. Kahemba ako kendaga na meso saviya mntu mlomo wakwe naukalonga milosi ya kweduvya.<verse eid="DAN 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwoni mwa yudya akwikala mazuwa yose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 7:9" />Umo nichei nakaula, vigoda vyo useuta niyo vyekigwa aho. Mdalahala ywa Kale niyo eza kwikala. Nendile kavika suche ing'aile chwee, fili zakwe nazing'ala chwee. Chigoda chakwe cho useuta chendaga cha myale ya moto ne chigoda chakwe chendaga mlanga mwe mafingili yakwaka moto. <verse eid="DAN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 7:10" />Mwe icho ichigoda mlawa mto wa moto ujuluzike wajinka kulongozi kwakwe. Maelufu ya wandima wa kwembingu wamsankanila na mamilioni ya wandima wa kwembingu wachimala kulongozi kwakwe. Chitala niyo chekalwa na vitabu niyo vyagubulwa.<verse eid="DAN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 7:11" />Umo hajendeleza kukaula kwachausa che imilosi yo kweduvya ikulongwa ni kadya akahembe. Niyo najendeleza kukaula kubula yudya mnyama achinjwa, mwili wakwe ubalangwa na kudulwa mo udya umoto ukwaka. <verse eid="DAN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 7:12" />Yadya amakala amatuhu niyo yahokwa udahi wo kulongoza, mna yoyo yenye yalekwa vileke yekale kwa chipindi chijihi.<verse eid="DAN 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 7:13" />Mo uwoni wangu wa nechilo, siwona chintu chikwinga mntu akwiza mwa amaingu, niyo amsogeila yudya Mdalahala ywa Kale niyo amlongoza kulongozi kwakwe. <verse eid="DAN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 7:14" />Niyo enkigwa udahi na ntunyo na useuta, vileke awantu wa amakabila yose ne isi yose na malonga yose wamsankanile. Ulongozi wakwe ni wamazuwa yose no useuta wakwe hautende na udumo.<verse eid="DAN 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ufyambulo wo uwoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 7:15" />Uwoni niwone miye Danieli unehela niyo yanagadisa mo moyo. <verse eid="DAN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 7:16" />Niyo nasogeila yumwenga mwa wadya wandima wa kwembingu, namuza imana yenye ye izimbuli zose izo. Elo, niyo anigambila imana yakwe. <verse eid="DAN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 7:17" />Kanigamba, “Ayo makala amakulu amane ni maseuta wane nawalaile mweisi. <verse eid="DAN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 7:18" />Mna wantu wakukile wa Chohile Mkulu nawenkigwe useuta utende wawo mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="DAN 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 7:19" />Vikaheza, niyo naunga nimanye kumlanga diya idikala dya kane, idyo dyendile dyesimana vitendese na yadya amatuhu, dikwehela na kutisisa, idyo ameno yakwe yendaga ya chuma na makombe yakwe yendaga ya shaba. Kajeseza ayo ameno kudya na kutagantiza awankondo wakwe na kujatajata chintu chochose chisigale kwa nyayo zakwe. <verse eid="DAN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 7:20" />Iviya niyo naunga nimanye mwe yadya amahembe mlongo endile nayo mo umtwi wakwe na kadya akahembe akamwenga ako umo hekenati kuhota yahasuka mahembe matatu, kahembe kendile na meso na mlomo ulongile milosi ya kweduvya. Kahembe ako kendaga udahi kujinka amahembe amatuhu.<verse eid="DAN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 7:21" />Umo nichei nakaula, kahembe ako niyo kagomba nkondo na wantu wa Chohile na kuwahuda. <verse eid="DAN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 7:22" />Mna yudya Mdalahala ywa Kale niyo enuka na kuwenka uhuda awantu wa Chohile kwaviya chipindi chawo cho kwinkwa useuta nendile chibule.<verse eid="DAN 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 7:23" />Niyo anigambila vino, “Diya idikala dya kane ni useuta wa kane nautendeke mweisi. Useuta uwo nautende wesimana ne iziseuta izintuhu, uwo nauibalange isi yose. Nauilagaze hasi na kuitula vihandehande. <verse eid="DAN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 7:24" />Yadya amaheme mlongo ni maseuta nawalawe mo useuta uwo. Wakaheza nawatimilwe ni seuta mtuhu uyo natende kesima na wadya awatuhu wamlongoile, uyo nalagaze maseuta watatu. <verse eid="DAN 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 7:25" />Uyo namhulute Chohile Mkulu na kuwasulumiza wantu wa Chohile. Najeze kuhituila imihilimo ye izingasu ne izisigilizi zawo. Wantu wa Chohile nawatende mwe ulongozi wakwe kwa mihilimo mitatu na nusu. <verse eid="DAN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 7:26" />Mna chitala cha kwembingu nachilavye nkanto, awo nawamhoke ulongozi wakwe, uyo nauswe na kubalangiswa. <verse eid="DAN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 7:27" />Useuta na ulongozi we iziseuta zose mweisi nawenkigwe wantu wa Chohile. Useuta wakwe nautende useuta wa kale na kale na maseuta wose nawamsankanile na kumwiva.”<verse eid="DAN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 7:28" />Uwo nuwo uhelo we imbuli iyo. Fanyanyi zangu zinilumiza miye Danieli, niyo navilikila mo uso wangu. Mna imbuli iyo niyo najendeleza kuikumbuka mo umoyo wangu.<verse eid="DAN 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DAN 8" />
  <para style="s">Uwoni wa Danieli wa dolome na vulata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 8:1" />Mo mhilimo wa katatu wo ulongozi wa seuta Belishaza ywa Babeli, miye Danieli nawonaga uwoni mtuhu. <verse eid="DAN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 8:2" />Mo uwoni wangu miye sewona nimndani mwe ngome ya Shushani mo mkowa wa Elamu. Sewona sichimala hampezo Homto wa Ulai <verse eid="DAN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 8:3" />Sikaula kulanga niyo nawona dolome dina mahembe maidi dichimala hampezo ho umto. Idihembe idimwenga dyendaga tali kujinka idimwenga, mna diya idodo niyo dyajendeleza kukula nyumani. <verse eid="DAN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 8:4" />Siwona idya indolome ikahamila kwa mahembe yakwe kuhinga uswelo wa zuwa na chenya na kwamwenyemzi. Hahana mnyama yoyose adahile kumchinda hegu kwenega izinguvu zakwe. Kadamanya viya akunga uyo niyo atendesa na nguvu. <verse eid="DAN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 8:5" />Umo hasungulumanya mbuli iyo, chipumpa vulata dina hembe dimwenga dikulise hagatigati ha ameso yakwe diza kulawa ntendele ya uswelo wa zuwa, nadikagulukisa mweisi yose viga vyakwe havikukufya hasi. <verse eid="DAN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 8:6" />Diza dikahinga kweidya indolome ina mahembe maidi niwone ikachimala hampezo ho umto na kuyebunga kwa maya yatendese. <verse eid="DAN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 8:7" />Siwona idivulata dikaisogeila idya indolome na kuyebunga kwa maya yatendese na kuihasula yadya amahembe amaidi. Idya indolome idunduga uhigani vyaleka yazagwa hasi na kujatwajatwa, hahendile na yoyose ywa kuyambiza kulawa mo kwebungwa ni diya idivulata. <verse eid="DAN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 8:8" />Diya idivulata niyo dyakulisa. Mna dize dibule uhelo we izinguvu zakwe, diya idihembe dyakwe iditali niyo dyahasuka. Hantu hakwe niyo yahota mahembe mane makulu kuhinga ntendele nne ze isi, chila dimwenga ntendele yakwe. <verse eid="DAN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 8:9" />Mwe dihembe idimwenga mwe yadya amane niyo kwahota kahembe, niyo kakulisa kuhinga ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi na ulailo wa zuwa na kuhinga kwesi ntana vitendese. <verse eid="DAN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 8:10" />Hembe idyo niyo dyatendesa na nguvu dyabula kwe vyumbe vikwikala kwembingu, kugamba kwezintondo, digwisa hasi ntondo zimwenga na kuzijatajata. <verse eid="DAN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 8:11" />Hembe idyo niyo dyeduvya kugamba dina nguvu kujinka Sekulu ywe vyumbe ywa kwembingu. Dichinda wantu wasekumlaviza Chohile ntambiko za kutikimya nakalavizwa sekulu ywe vyumbe chila zuwa, niyo ahuluta ahantu akwikala. <verse eid="DAN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 8:12" />Wantu wa Chohile wazumila kulongozwa ni kadya akahembe, kwaviya wamhituka Chohile. Wantu wa Chohile ne izintambiko zawo za chila zuwa ziguhigwa ni kadya akahembe. Kahembe kawachinda wantu wasekuzumila ichindedi. Niyo kachumilwa mwe chila chintu kakunga. <verse eid="DAN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 8:13" />Vikaheza niyo namwiva mndima ywa kwembingu yumwenga alonga na mnyawe, “Togola mbuli zino zilongigwe mo uwoni uno nazilaile umo ini? Malavyo ya kutikimya ya chila zuwa nayachindwe kubula ini? Ubanasi wa kubalanga chila chintu na ujendeleze na ahantu hakukile hamwenga ne vyumbe vya kwembingu navijendeleze kujatwa?” <verse eid="DAN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 8:14" />Niyo namwiva yudya mndima ywa kwembingu ywa nkongo ahitula, “Navijendeleze kwa mazuwa elufu mbili na magana matatu chilo na msi. Vikaheza Inyumba ya Chohile naikwe ukuka vituhu.”<verse eid="DAN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndima ywa kwembingu Gabulieli atapita uwoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 8:15" />Miye Danieli sijeza kusungulumanya imana yo uwoni uwo, umo hajeza kusungulumanya chani nimanye imanakwe, chipumpa yumwenga akwinga mntu niyo achimala kulongozi kwangu. <verse eid="DAN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 8:16" />Niyo neva izwi dya mntu kulawa mo umto wa Ulai dyetanga, “Gabulieli mtambalisize yuno mntu imana yo uwoni awone.” <verse eid="DAN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 8:17" />Gabulieli keza hajihi na hadya nichimale. Miye niyo nogohesa vyaleka nafika madi mwe sanga. Mna niyo anigamba, “Weye mntu manya kugamba uwoni uwone ni mbuli zikulanga mazuwa yo udumo we isi.” <verse eid="DAN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 8:18" />Umo akalonga na miye, niyo natozwa ni ntongo kuno sigwa chifudifudi. Mna niyo anitoza na kunichimalisa. <verse eid="DAN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 8:19" />Niyo anigamba, “Tegeleza, nahugambile ulailo wa mbuli za amaya ya Chohile ivyo nazitende, uwoni walagisa kugamba nolaile chipindi chisagulwe ni Chohile. Uwo nautende udumo wa chila chintu.” <verse eid="DAN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 8:20" />Idya indolome ina mahembe maidi uwone, mahembe ayo yalagisa maseuta waidi, hembe dimwenga ni seuta ywa Mediya na hembe dya kaidi ni seuta ywa Pelisiya. <verse eid="DAN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 8:21" />Diya idivulata ni seuta ywa Ugiliki. Diya idihembe idikulu hagatigati ha ameso yakwe ni seuta ywa nkongo ywa Ugiliki. <verse eid="DAN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 8:22" />Diya idihembe dihasuke ahantu hakwe niyo hahota mahembe mane, ni kugamba useuta uwo umwenga nawepange utende seuta nne, mna iziseuta izo hazitende na nguvu saziya zo useuta wa nkongo. <verse eid="DAN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 8:23" />Umo mo udumo we izo iziseuta no ubanasi wawo unatendesa, nakulaile seuta yumwenga mkwakwa naho mpapala. <verse eid="DAN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 8:24" />Uyo natende na udahi mkulu, nahose ubanasi ukulise naho nachumilwe mwe chila mbuli akudamanya. Nakome wantu wamanyikise na wakuka wa Chohile. <verse eid="DAN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 8:25" />Kwa upapala wakwe nachumilwe mwe mizungu yakwe yo kubunyanya wantu, uyo neduvye. Nakome wantu walozize kuno hawamanyize naho naunge agombe nkondo na Sekulu ywa masekulu, mna nakomwe hehena kujeseza udahi wa chimntu. <verse eid="DAN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 8:26" />“Uwoni mwe mbuli za ntambiko za mtondo na chisingi ni chindedi. Mna usekuzilonga kwaviya ni chinyele, nakujinke chipindi chitali hewinati kulaila.” <verse eid="DAN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 8:27" />Ayo yeze yajinke miye Danieli niyo nafa chififimbazi na kuhuma kwa mazuwa masiku. Eze nihone niyo najendeleza kumsankanila seuta. Mna udya uwoni unehela sidunduga kuubunkula.<verse eid="DAN 8:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DAN 9" />
  <para style="s">Danieli alombezeza wantu wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 9:1" />Mo mhilimo wa nkongo wo ulongozi wa Dalio endaga mwana ywa Ahasuelo, mwelekwa ywa Umedi uyo atendagwe chilongozi mo useuta wa Babeli, <verse eid="DAN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 9:2" />mo mhilimo wa nkongo wo kulongoza kwakwe Dalio, miye Danieli sikombaganya kulawana no kusoma Mawandiko yakukile ya Chohile alagiswe muwoni Yelemiya kugamba kubalangwa ko umzi wa Yelusalemu nakusigale mahame kwa mihilimo milongo mfungate. <verse eid="DAN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 9:3" />Elo, niyo namlombeza Zumbe Chohile kwa moyo wangu wose na kumweila na kufunga niyo navala suche za majuniya na kwebuluga maivu kulagisa kugamba nna chinyulu. <verse eid="DAN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 9:4" />Simlombeza Zumbe Chohile ywangu kwa kweila kuhitukila na kuleka masa, hagamba, “Weye Zumbe, weye wi Chohile mkulu ywa kutunyiswa. Weye wi mkanuni mwe lagano dyako naho wawafila mbazi kwa wadya wakukunga na kutimila sigilizi zako, <verse eid="DAN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 9:5" />chikola masa, chibalanga chidamanya wavu naho chikulemela weye. Chihituka amalagizo yako ne imiko yako. <verse eid="DAN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 9:6" />Wandima wako wawoni hachiwetegeleze, awo walongaga na maseuta wetu na wakulu wetu na wadalahala wetu na wantu wose we isi yetu. <verse eid="DAN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 9:7" />Zumbe dyetu, mazuwa yose wadamanya vikuwagila, mna zuwa dino dya dyelo chimema soni, wagosi wa Yuda na wantu wa Yelusalemu ne isi yose ya Izulaeli, wose wahajihi na we hale mwe izisi zose uchizagaze kwachausa chetu cha kuswesa ukanuni kwako. <verse eid="DAN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 9:8" />Weye Zumbe, suwe na maseuta wetu na wakulu wetu na wadalahala wetu chimema soni kwaviya chikukola masa weye. <verse eid="DAN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 9:9" />Weye Zumbe Chohile ywetu kumema mbazi na kulekeila masa ya wantu hata hegu suwe chikuhituka. <verse eid="DAN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 9:10" />Nachilemela kukwiva, weye Zumbe Chohile ywetu, hachikale kutimila izisigilizi zako uchinkile kwa sila ya wandima wako wawoni. <verse eid="DAN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 9:11" />Wantu wose wa Izulaeli wose waihituka isingilizi yako, wakwasa niyo walemela kukwetegeleza. Kwaviya chikubalanga chiligitwa ni vyeliso viwandikwe mwe isigilizi ya mndima ywako Musa. <verse eid="DAN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 9:12" />Elo, kuchintiza viya ulongile nochidamanyize suwe hamwenga ne vilongozi wetu kwa kuubalangisa umzi wa Yelusalemu kujinka mzi mtuhu wowose mwe isi. <verse eid="DAN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 9:13" />Saviya viwandikwe mwe isigilizi ya Musa, file zino zose zichigwela suwe, mna hata vino haluse, hachilombeze chifilwe mbazi ni weye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu kwa kuleka amasa yetu na kumanya ukanuni wako. <verse eid="DAN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 9:14" />Elo, weye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu, nakwemalanya kale uchikantile, naho niyo wadamanya seivyo, kwaviya mazuwa yose wadamanya viya vikuwagila, naswi hachikwetegeleze. <verse eid="DAN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 9:15" />Haluselo, weye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu, uwalavize wantu wako kweisi ya Misili kwa udahi wako mkulu, chagamba vino chikukola masa, chidamanya wavu. <verse eid="DAN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 9:16" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, kuligana na ntendwa zako zo uwagilwa usekuwehiwa na kuwafila maya awantu wo umzi wa Yelusalemu, lugulu lwako lukukile. Wantu wose we izisi zikuchizunguluka waubela umzi wa Yelusalemu na wantu wako kwachausa cha masa yetu na ubanasi watendile wakale wetu. <verse eid="DAN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 9:17" />Elo, weye Chohile ywetu kwetegeleze umviko wangu na amalombezo ya miye mndima ywako. Kwa uwagilwa wako uwonele mbazi vituhu Inyumba yako ibalangwe. <verse eid="DAN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 9:18" />Weye Chohile, Chohile ywangu tegeleza wive, kaula uwone nkunto chinanazo ne ivyo umzi wako ivyo ukutumbwazika. Chakulaviza malombezo yetu sivyo kugamba chidamanya mbuli zikuwagila, mna kwaviya weye una mbazi zitendese. <verse eid="DAN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 9:19" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, chetegeleze uchilekeile amasa yetu, weye Zumbe Chohile. Weye Zumbe Chohile kwa uwagilwa wako chetegeleze naho guha nkacho, naho usekukalamiza, weye Chohile ywangu, kwaviya uno umzi na wano wantu wako mwenye.”<verse eid="DAN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndima ywa kwembingu Gabulieli atapita uwoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 9:20" />Elo, umo nichei halombeza, heila amasa yangu na amasa ya awantu wangu wa Izulaeli na kumweila Zumbe Chohile kwachausa cho lugulu lwakwe Iukukile, <verse eid="DAN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 9:21" />umo nichei halombeza yudya Gabulieli namwone mo uwoni aho nkongo, niyo asunguza kusela kubula hadya hantu nili. Nendile ni chipindi cha kulavya ntambiko ya chisingi. <verse eid="DAN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 9:22" />Niyo anigamba, “Danieli, miye siza hano vileke hwinke ubala na udahi wa kumanya uwoni uwo. <verse eid="DAN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 9:23" />Ahadya wize ukonge kulombeza, Chohile niyo akuhitula, miye siza kukugambila ivyo ahitule kwaviya Chohile akungisa. Elo kwetegelezese iyvo akuhitule na kumanya uwoni uwo.” <verse eid="DAN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 9:24" />“Chipindi cha majuma milongo mfungate ikwa kwachausa cha wantu wako na kwachausa cho lugulu lwako lukukile chani wavu ubindwe na kuchinda masa na kulekeila wavu na kwigala uwagila wa mazuwa yose na kujela hula uwoni na ulotezi na kuhaka mavuta Hantu Hakukise. <verse eid="DAN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 9:25" />Elo, ubunkule na kumanya imbuli ino. Kukongela ichipindi nadilavigwe lagizo dya kuzengwa uhya umzi wa Yelusalemu kubula umo akwizila uyo mkulu asagulwe ni Chohile. Majuma milongo mfungate naijinke na kwa majuma milongo mtandatu na maidi, umzi wa Yelusalemu nauzengwe uhya nakutende na nkunto zitendese mwe chipindi icho. <verse eid="DAN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 9:26" />Yakaheza majuma ayo milongo mtandatu na maidi, yudya asagulwe ni Zumbe Chohile nakomwe naho hasigale na chintu. Wantu wa chilongozi akwiza nawaubalange umzi hamwenga na ahantu hakukile. Udumo wo umzi uwo nawize saviya nkulujumbu ya mazi. Nakutende na nkondo na ubanasi saviya vikigwe ni Chohile. <verse eid="DAN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 9:27" />Chilongozi uyo nadamanye wivano utogile na wantu walozize kwa mihilimo mfungate. Ikaheza inusu ye imihilimo iyo mfungate nachinde ntambiko za malavyo. Hantu he mazabahu ye Inyumba ya Chohile nahachimaliswe ihizo dyo ubanasi, idyo nadisigaile aho kubula yudya adichimalise nakomwe saviya Chohile aikiye.”<verse eid="DAN 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DAN 10" />
  <para style="s">Uwoni wa Danieli hampezo ho umto wa Tigili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 10:1" />Mo mhilimo wa katatu wo ulongozi wa seuta Koleshi ywa Uwajemi, Danieli uyudya naketangwa Beliteshaza, kenkigwa uwoni. Uwoni uwo wendaga wa chindedi mna mdala, ukulanga masulumizo makulu. Umanyi wo ulosi uwo utambaliswa mwe uwoni. <verse eid="DAN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 10:2" />Chipindi hawona ayo, miye Danieli nahalomboleza kwa majuma matatu. <verse eid="DAN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 10:3" />Sidile nkande yedi naho sidile nyama hegu kunywa divai naho majuma yose ayo matatu sekulugute mavuta. <verse eid="DAN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 10:4" />Zuwa dya mlongo na nne dyo umwezi wa nkongo, nendile sichimala hampezo ho umto wa Tigili. <verse eid="DAN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 10:5" />Niyo nakaula kulanga, nawona mntu availe suche zing'aile, mwechigudi kanyinya msipi wa zahabu ichiligwe. <verse eid="DAN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 10:6" />Umwili wakwe nendile ukang'ala saviya yuwe dikwitangwa zabalajadi, uso wakwe naukenga lumwemwe na ameso yakwe yendaga yekaka enga myale ya moto. Viga vyakwe ne imikono naikang'ala saviya shaba ichiliswe. Izwi dyakwe nendile dikazuzumba saviya fyo dya wantu. <verse eid="DAN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 10:7" />Nendile ni miye ichedu niwone uwo uwoni. Wadya awantu wendile hamwenga na miye hawauwone uwo uwoni, mna wengilwa ni nkama vitendese vyaleka wasumka na kwefisa. <verse eid="DAN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 10:8" />Elo, niyo nasigwa ichedu hakaula uwoni uwo ukwehela. Niyo nasilwa ni nguvu, uso wangu uhitukila na kuvilikila vyaleka hahana mntu akudaha kunikombaganya. <verse eid="DAN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 10:9" />Eze nive idizwi dyakwe niyo nagwa hasi chifudifudi na kutozwa ni ntongo folilo. <verse eid="DAN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 10:10" />Ahadya, niyo natozwa mkono wanichimalisa na kudindimaza iviga vyangu ne imikono yangu. <verse eid="DAN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 10:11" />Mndima ywa kwembingu Gabulieli niyo anigamba, “Danieli, Chohile akungisa, chimala chululu wetegelezese ulosi hunga hugambile, kwaviya sisigilwa kwako.” Umo akanigambila ivyo, niyo nachimala kuno nazingiza. <verse eid="DAN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 10:12" />Akaheza, niyo anigamba, “Danieli usekogoha. Chohile keva idilombezo dyako kukongela zuwa diya dya nkongo ukongile kunyanyahala kulongozi kwa Chohile chani umanye. Miye siza chani nihitule amalombezo yako. <verse eid="DAN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 10:13" />Mna mwamizi ywa useuta wa Uwajeni kanichinda kwa mazuwa milongo midi na dimwenga. Mikaeli yumwe mwa masekulu mwa awandima wa Chohile niyo eza kunambiza, kwaviya mkulu ywa mpepo ywa Uwajemi nendile kanichinda. <verse eid="DAN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 10:14" />Haluse siza hugambile mbuli zikunga ziwalaile awantu wako chipindi chikwiza, kwaviya uwoni uwone ni wa chipindi chikwiza.” <verse eid="DAN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 10:15" />Umo akanigambila mbuli izo sisinyiza hasi sidunduga kulonga mbuli yoyose kwaviya nahogohesa. <verse eid="DAN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 10:16" />Vikaheza, mndima ywa kwembingu atenda enga mntu anikufya imilomo yangu, miye niyo nakonga kulonga vituhu namgamba yudya achimale hajihi na miye, “Weye sekulu ywangu, uwoni uno unigaila ulumi utendese vileka siswesa nguvu. <verse eid="DAN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 10:17" />Miye ni saviya mtumwa achimale kulongozi kwa sekulu ywakwe. Nanidahe vivihi kulonga na weye? Sisilwa ni nguvu hata kuhema sikudaha.” <verse eid="DAN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 10:18" />Yudya mndima ywa kwembingu akwinga mntu niyo anikufya nkanana ntuhu, anijela nguvu. <verse eid="DAN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 10:19" />Niyo anigamba, “Chohile akungisa, elo usekogoha tondowala. Utoge naho utende mkankalu.” Eze alonge ivyo, niyo natenda na nguvu namgamba, “Sekulu, kunidindimaza haluse longa chiya nokonga ulonge.” <verse eid="DAN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 10:20" />Niyo anigamba, “Togola kuvimanya kwambwani sikubasa? Vino haluse nauya hagombe nkondo na mwamizi ywa Pelisiya. Ukajika, haheza kumhuda uyo, nalaile mwamizi ywa Ugiliki. <verse eid="DAN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 10:21" />Mna nahugambile ziya ziwandikwe mwe chitabu che chindedi. Hahana mtuhu ywa kunambiza kuwahuda wano ukaleke Mikaeli mwamizi ywa Waizulaeli.”<verse eid="DAN 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DAN 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 11:1" />Mo mhilimo wa nkongo wo ulongozi wa seuta Dalio mntu ywa Uwajemi miye mndima ywa kwembingu selavya kumwambiza na kumdima. <verse eid="DAN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 11:2" />Haluse nahugambile ichindedi che izimbuli izo. Nakulaile maseuta watatu wata nguvu nawalongoze Pelisiya. Awo watatu wakaheza nakulaile seuta ywa kane. Uyo n atende mgoli kujinka waseuta wose walongozaga uyo henati. Uyo natendese na nguvu kwachausa cho ugoli wakwe, nawaluvye wantu wose wauhige useuta wa Ugiliki.<verse eid="DAN 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta za Misili na Siliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 11:3" />Vikaheza nakulaile seuta mkankalu akunga alongoze chinguvu vitendese na kudamanya viya akunga. <verse eid="DAN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 11:4" />Hata ivyo, udumo wo udahi wakwe, useuta wakwe nautulwe na kusangwa ntendele nne za kwembingu. Welekwa wakwe hawalongoze vituhu hawatende na udahi saviya uyo, kwaviya useuta wakwe nauguhigwe ni wantu watuhu. <verse eid="DAN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 11:5" />“Seuta ywa Misili natende na nguvu. Mna yumwenga ywa amasekulu wakwe natende na nguvu kumjinka uyo na ulongozi wakwe nautende ukulisa. <verse eid="DAN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 11:6" />Inajinka mihilimo misiku nawadamanye wivano. Mchiche ywa seuta ywa Misili nasolwe mwe ikaya ya wantu wa Siliya. Mna hajendeleza kutenda na nguvu, iviya seuta ywa welekwa wakwe hawajijimize, mchiche uyo mwenye na mwanawe na watumwa wakwe we ichiche etile nawo, wose nawakomwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 11:7" />Nyumani, yumwenga ywa ulokolo lwa uyo mchiche natende seuta. Mntu uyo nawebunge awagomba nkondo wa seuta ywa Siliya na kwingila mwe ngome yawo, nagombe nkondo nawo na kuwahuda. <verse eid="DAN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 11:8" />Uyo nayaguhe amatukulu yo kusana ye imilungu yawo ne iviya vya yombe kulu vya chumbu na zahabu kubula kweisi ya Misili. Kwa mihilimo misiku, seuta ywa Misili hamwebunge seuta ywa Siliya. <verse eid="DAN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 11:9" />Vikaheza, nyumani seuta ywa Siliya nawebunge useuta wa Misili, mna navimunge auye kweisi yakwe.” <verse eid="DAN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 11:10" />“Vikaheza wana wa seuta ywa Siliya nawachisanye fyo dya wagomba nkondo wemalanye kwa nkondo. Fyo idyo nadijendeleze kulongozi saviya nkulujumbu ya mazi yabohole nadijinke na kugomba nkondo kubula kweingome ya wankondo wawo.” <verse eid="DAN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 11:11" />Vikaheza, seuta ywa Misili kwachausa cha amaya yakwe nagombe nkondo na seuta ywa Siliya nahigane kwa fyo kulu dya wagomba nkondo, mna fyo idyo dya Siliya nadihudwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 11:12" />Anaheza kudihudisa idifyo dya Siliya na kukoma Maelufu yalozize, nakonge kweduvya mna hajendeleze kutenda mhuda. <verse eid="DAN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 11:13" />“Kwaviya seuta ywa Siliya nyumani namalanye fyo dya wagomba nkondo dikulise kujinka diya dya nkongo. Inajinka mihilimo misiku nauye na fyo dikulise dya wagomba nkondo dina viziha vilozese.” <verse eid="DAN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 11:14" />“Mwe ichipindi icho wantu walozize nawamlemele seuta ywa Misili. Wantu wasiku manyakwili we isi yako weye Danieli nawahitukile vileke wachintize uno uwoni, mna nawadunduge. <verse eid="DAN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 11:15" />Elo, seuta ywa Siliya nautandame na kuwebuna umzi une ngome itogese na kuutaha. Wagomba nkondo wa Misili nawadunduge kuwachinda, hata mabunga yawo ya wagomba nkondo wadahise kugomba nkondo hawatende na nguvu za kuhigana nawo. <verse eid="DAN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 11:16" />Uyo seuta ywa Siliya nadamanye viya akunga, hahana najeze kuhigana naye. Nachimale mweisi ikukile, ne isi iyo yose naitende mwe ulongozi wakwe.” <verse eid="DAN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 11:17" />“Seuta ywa Siliya nekambe eze na bunga wagomba nkondo wakwe wose, uyo nadamanye wivano na kuuchintiza. Uyo namloze mchiche ywakwe asolwe nuyo vileke aubalange useuta wa mnkondo ywakwe, mna mzungu wakwe hauchumilwe hegu kumwambiza mbuli yoyose. <verse eid="DAN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 11:18" />Nyumani nazihitukile na kuzebunga izisi zilozize za mpwani na kuzihuda. Mna sekulu ywa wagomba nkondo mjeni namhude seuta ywa Siliya na kuchinda ukweduvya kwakwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 11:19" />Aho seuta ywa Siliya nahituke vileke auye kwe izingome ze isi yakwe mwenye, mna nahudwe na kukomwa kwe nkondo, uwo nautende nuwo udumo wakwe.” <verse eid="DAN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 11:20" />“Uyo natimilwe ni seuta mtuhu akunga achisanya ushulu kujenyeza ugoli mwe hazina yakwe. Seuta uyo nakomwe yakaheza mazuwa majeche, mna suko kwe nkondo hegu kwihiwa ni wantu.”<verse eid="DAN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta mwavu ywa Siliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 11:21" />Mndima ywa kwembingu kajendeleza kumgambila Danieli, “Uyo akunga alongoze natende ni mntu ywa kubelwa henkigwe ntunyo yo useuta. Nawebunge useuta wantu wakwe wakewona wemwe utondowazi, uyo nauguhe chinguvu. <verse eid="DAN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 11:22" />Yoyose akunga amhige, hata hegu ni Mlavyantambiko Mkulu ywe Inyumba ya Chohile, nawadwile hale na kuwakoma <verse eid="DAN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 11:23" />Naho nadamanya wivano na vilongozi wa si ntuhu mna nawadante, naho najendeleze kutenda na nguvu, mna nalongoze wantu wajeche du. <verse eid="DAN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 11:24" />Nazebungu ntendele ze mikowa zina ugoli utendese na kujesa chisimo hechidamanywe hata ni yumwenga mwa awadalahala wakwe wamlongwele. Akaheza nawapangile wambuyaze ugoli ne vintu atahile kwe nkondo hamwenga na wantu atahile. Nadamanye mizungu kuyebunga mizi izengelwe ngome, mna ni kwachipindi chijihi du..” <verse eid="DAN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 11:25" />“Kwa ukankalu nachisanye fyo kulu dya wagomba nkondo vileke awebunge useuta wa Misili, seuta ywa Siliya navuzize ukwebungwa uko kwa fyo dikulise naho dina nguvu zitendese. Mna seuta ywa Misili hachumilwe kwaviya mizungu yakwe ye ichinyakwili naidamanywe mwakwe mwenye. <verse eid="DAN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 11:26" />Wadya wakudya hamwenga naye, nawo nawamkome. Wagomba nkondo wakwe walozize nawakomwe kwenkondo. <verse eid="DAN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 11:27" />Aho, wadya maseuta waidi nawekale na kudya nkande hamwenga mwe meza imwe, mna chila yumwenga namfanyanyize wihi mnyawe na kudantana. Mna hawachumilwe kwaviya chipindi chikigwe hachinati kubula.” <verse eid="DAN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 11:28" />Seuta ywa Siliya nauye kweisi yakwe akatenda na ugoli ulozese, mna umo akajinka mwe sila nawebunge wantu wakutimila Lagano dya Chohile, akaheza nauye kweisi yakwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 11:29" />“Mwe ichipindi chikigwe ni Chohile seuta ywa Siliya nayebunge isi ya Misili kwa nkanana ntuhu, mna ntambo ino mbuli nazihituke kwaviya hachumilwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 11:30" />Meli kulawa kweisi ya Kitimu, nivyo kugamba Walumi nazimwebunge, naye nengilwe ni luchenyenta. Akaheza nauye chisengelenyuma kuno kamema maya na kuwebunga wantu wa Izulaeli wakutimila Lagano Dikukile dya Chohile.” <verse eid="DAN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 11:31" />Wagomba nkondo wakwe nawaijele uzavu Inyumba ya Chohile ne izingome zakwe, nawachinde izintambiko zo kutikimya za chila zuwa na kuchimalisa ihizo dyo ubanasi. <verse eid="DAN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 11:32" />Seuta nawaluvye kwa udanti wadya wadihituke idilagano, mna wadya wantu wakanuni kwa Chohile ywawo nawachimale chigosi na kumhiga. <verse eid="DAN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 11:33" />Wantu wako wata ubala mwe vilongozi nawahinye walozize. Mna ni kwachipindi chijihi du wakaheza nawakomwe kwa mabamba hegu kokwa moto hegu kugwilwa na kutendwa watahigwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 11:34" />Umo kukomwa kwa wantu wa Chohile kukajendeleza nawenkwe wambizi, mna awo wakuwambiza nawatende ivyo kwa udanti du. <verse eid="DAN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 11:35" />Wadya wata ubala wasiku nawakomwe, mna ulailo wo kukomwa kwawo nakuhose wakukizwe. Ivyo navijendele kubula chipindi cha udumo chikigwe ni Chohile. <verse eid="DAN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 11:36" />“Seuta ywa Siliya nadamanye viya akunga. Neduvye na kwefutula kugamba ni mkulu kujinka milungu yose na kumhuluta Chohile mkulu kujinka milungu yose. Najendeleze kutenda ivyo kubula akantilwa ni Chohile, kwaviya mbuli zikigwa vyaungwa zichinte. <verse eid="DAN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 11:37" />Seuta uyo haitunye imilungu ya wakale wakwe hegu yudya mnungu akungiswa ni wavyele. Milungu mituhu yose naibele, kwaviya netende mkulu kujinka chila yumwenga. <verse eid="DAN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 11:38" />Hantu he milungu iyo namtunye mnungu mdima ingome, uyo wakale wakwe hawajezaga kumvikila, namlavize zahabu na chumbu na mayuwe ya yombe kulu na majeleko ya yombe kulu. <verse eid="DAN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 11:39" />Namile izingome zakwe kwa wambizi wa mnungu ywa chijeni. Wadya nawamzumile kugamba ni seuta nawatunyise. Nawatende walongoze wantu watuhu na kuwapangila sanga saviya jeleko.” <verse eid="DAN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 11:40" />“Chipindi cho udumo cha seuta ywa Misili namwebunge seuta ywa Siliya. Mna seuta ywa Siliya navuzize ukwebungwa uko kwa nguvu saviya luzimu, akajeseza malingisha na wakwela falasi na meli zilozize. Nebunge si zilozize na kujinka mwe izisi izo saviya nkulujumbu ya mazi yabohole. <verse eid="DAN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 11:41" />Iviya nayebunge isi ya Izulaeli na kukoma maelufu ya wantu. Mna wantu we izisi za Edomu na Moabu ne ntendele nkulu ya Amoni nawambulwe kulawa mwe mikono yakwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 11:42" />Umo akazebunga izisi izo hata isi ya Misili haihone. <verse eid="DAN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 11:43" />Naguhe ihazina ye zahabu ne chumbu na mayuwe ya yombe kulu na ugoli we isi ya Misili. Nawahude awantu wa Libiya na Isiopya awo nawatende wandima wakwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 11:44" />Mna milosi nailawe ulailo wa zuwa na ntendele ya chenya nazimtise. Uyo nahalawe kwa maya yatendese vileke abalange na kukoma wantu walozize. <verse eid="DAN 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 11:45" />Ukaleka ivyo, nachimalise mahema yakwe makulu hagati he ibahali no ulugulu lukukile. Mna natende kabula udumo wakwe, naho hahatende na yoyose ywa kumwambiza.”<verse eid="DAN 11:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DAN 12" />
  <para style="s">Chipindi cho udumo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 12:1" />Mwe ichipindi icho, mndima mkulu ywa kwembingu Mikaeli, uyo mdimi ywa wantu wako, nalaile. Aho nakutende na chipindi cha nkunto zitendese kujinka mihilimo mituhu yose kukongela nkongelo ye izisi kubula ichipindi icho. Mna mwe ichipindi icho, chila yumwenga mwa awantu wako, uyo awandikwe idizina dyakwe mwe ichitabu cho ujima nakombolwe. <verse eid="DAN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 12:2" />Wantu walozize wadya wabanike kale, nawauyuswe, watuhu nawenkwe ujima wa mazuwa yose, na watuhu nawenkwe soni na kubelwa mazuwa yose. <verse eid="DAN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 12:3" />Wadya wata ubala nawang'ale saviya ulanga na wadya wawalongoze awatuhu vileke wadamanye yedi, nawang'ale saviya ntondo mazuwa yose. <verse eid="DAN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 12:4" />“Mna haluse weye Danieli, mbuli izo zike chinyele, chifunge ichitabu na kuchijela hula kubula chipindi cho udumo chikabula. Wantu walozize nawadwangaye uko na uko na upapala nautendese.” <verse eid="DAN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 12:5" />Vikaheza miye Danieli niyo nakaula na kuwona wantu waidi wachimala mwe izinchingo zo umto, yumwenga ntendele ino na umtuhu ntendele ya kaidi. <verse eid="DAN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 12:6" />Yumwenga ywawo niyo amuza yudya achimale ntendele ya kuchenya yo umto availe suche zing'aile, “Izimbuli izo zikutisa nazikale chipindi chani kubula zisile?” <verse eid="DAN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 12:7" />Yudya mntu achimale ntendele ya kuchenya yo umto, availe suche zing'aile, niyo enula imikono yakwe kuhinga kwembingu. Vikaheza niyo namwiva akelisa kwa zina dya yudya mta ujima wa mazuwa yose, “Naitende mihilimo mitatu na nusu. Umo amasulumizo ya wantu wakukile nayachindwe, mbuli zose izo nazitende zichinta.” <verse eid="DAN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 12:8" />Siva, mna sikombaganye. Elo, niyo nauza, “Sekulu ywangu, udumo we izimbuli izo nautende vivihi?” <verse eid="DAN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 12:9" />Niyo ahitula, “Haluse, Danieli hita zako, kwaviya mbuli izo ni za chinyele nazo zigubikwa kwa kujelwa hula kubula chipindi cho udumo. <verse eid="DAN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 12:10" />Chipindi icho che zinkunto nachihose wantu walozize nawause uzavu wawo na kukukizwa. Mna wantu wakutenda uzavu nawajendeleze kutenda uzavu. Hahana hata yumwenga mwa awo wakutenda uzavu nakombaganye icho akudamanya Chohile, wata ubala nawo nawakombaganye.” <verse eid="DAN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 12:11" />Kukongela ichipindi yachindigwe amalavyo yo kutikimya ya chila zuwa, kugamba kukongela ichipindi chiya Ihizo dyo Ubanasi dichimaliswa, kugamba chintu chikuhosa mbuli zihiye mwa Ahantu Hakukile nakutende ni mazuwa elufu imwenga magana maidi na milongo chenda. <verse eid="DAN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 12:12" />Kajimbikwa yudya mntu akunga ajijimize kubula uhelo wa yadya amazuwa elufu imwenga magana matatu milongo mitatu na mashano. <verse eid="DAN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 12:13" />“Mna, weye Danieli kwemalanye ukatwete mwe mbila, chipindi icho chikabula nauyuswe na kwinkigwa jeleko dyako.”<verse eid="DAN 12:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 12" />
</usx>